{
  "name": "OI · Copia de seguridad semanal de las webs",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Domingos a las 3:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 3 * * 0"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0107",
      "position": [
        260,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Webs a copiar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "ID_DE_TU_HOJA",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gid=0",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Sheets (gratis)"
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0108",
      "position": [
        500,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Web a web",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "oi-0109",
      "position": [
        740,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Descargar la web",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "neverError": true
            }
          },
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0110",
      "position": [
        980,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Guardar en disco",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "write",
        "fileName": "=D:/backups/{{ $('Web a web').first().json.cliente }}/{{ $now.toFormat(\"yyyy-LL-dd\") }}.html",
        "dataPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "oi-0111",
      "position": [
        1220,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Anotar el resultado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const w = $('Web a web').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { cliente: w.cliente, url: w.url,\n  guardado: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10) } }];"
      },
      "id": "oi-0112",
      "position": [
        260,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Informe final",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const todo = $('Anotar el resultado').all().map(i => i.json);\nreturn [{ json: { total: todo.length,\n  linea: todo.map(t => '• ' + t.cliente).join('\\n') } }];"
      },
      "id": "oi-0113",
      "position": [
        500,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Informe de la copia",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "TU_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "=💾 <b>Copia semanal terminada</b>\\n{{ $json.total }} webs guardadas\\n{{ $json.linea }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "HTML"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Telegram Bot (gratis)"
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0114",
      "position": [
        740,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "oi-0115",
      "name": "Ficha",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 360,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 💾 Copia de seguridad semanal de las webs\n**auto-backup-webs**\n\nDescarga cada web de cliente y la guarda fechada en tu disco, con un informe de qué se copió y cuánto ocupa.\n\n**Disparador:** Programado · domingos a las 3:00\n\n**Coste: 0 €** — n8n autoalojado · Disco local · Gmail SMTP · Telegram Bot\n\n- Lee la lista de webs y su origen\n- Descarga el contenido de cada una\n- Lo guarda en carpeta con fecha en tu disco\n- Te manda el informe de la noche por Telegram"
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Domingos a las 3:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Webs a copiar",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Webs a copiar": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Web a web",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Web a web": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Informe final",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Descargar la web",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Descargar la web": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Guardar en disco",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Guardar en disco": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Anotar el resultado",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Anotar el resultado": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Web a web",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Informe final": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Informe de la copia",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveManualExecutions": true
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "OI Studio"
    },
    {
      "name": "coste 0"
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "instanceId": "oi-studio-biblioteca"
  }
}